"""Partial stubs for :mod:`zope.component`.

The ZCA lookup helpers are typed generically so that, e.g.,
``getUtility(IFoo)`` is inferred to return ``IFoo``. This replaces the type
information the ``mypy-zope`` plugin used to synthesise, and works across all
PEP 561 checkers.
"""

